        {
          "type": "Claim",
          "identifier": "globuli-cells-cholinergic-gabaergic",
          "role": "empirical",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "value": "The globuli cell cluster at the mushroom body heads of Uloborus diversus is revealed by ChAT immunoreactivity and to a lesser extent by GAD immunoreactivity, indicating that the globuli cells represent cholinergic and GABAergic populations; this is consistent with prior demonstration of ChAT-positive globuli cells in C. salei."
            }
          ],
          "epistemicStrength": "moderate",
          "relations": [
