        {
          "type": "Claim",
          "identifier": "mushroom-bodies-present-asta-exclusive",
          "role": "empirical",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "Text",
              "value": "Mushroom bodies are present in Uloborus diversus and retain the complete haft-body-head form with connecting bridge seen in cursorial spider species, contradicting reports of absent or simplified mushroom bodies in some web-building spider species; among all specific neurosignaling molecule antibodies tested, only allatostatin A (AstA) shows co-expression throughout the mushroom body, while other transmitter systems including 5-HT, TDC2, GABA, ChAT, proctolin, and CCAP do not."
            }
          ],
          "epistemicStrength": "strong",
          "relations": [
            {
